# EMR Adoption Strategy – Clinician First

EMR adoption is not a technology problem.
It is a **workflow trust and change management problem**.

## Key Challenges
- Clinician resistance
- Workflow disruption
- Training gaps
- Perceived documentation burden

## Adoption Principles
- Enable, do not mandate
- Start with high-impact departments
- Incremental rollout
- Continuous clinician feedback

## Success Factors
- Strong clinical champions
- On-ground handholding
- Workflow-aligned templates
- Visible leadership support

## Role of Digital Health Leaders
Reduce risk for clinicians and hospitals while improving care quality.
